+The owner removed the current soundtrack on 2026-10-06. Its source, native
+libraries and diagnostic test are preserved here, outside the Godot export root.
+The game no longer creates a DynamicMusicController or loads BMTMusicStream.
+This is a historical source archive, not an executable music feature or shipping
+asset. Original res://music paths describe the old project layout.
+
+The replacement vehicle sound mix is documented in docs/VEHICLE_AUDIO.md.
